  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mover><mo>&#8594;</mo><mrow><mi>dil</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>HCl</mi></mrow></mover><msub><mi>PbCl</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>(white precipitate)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mover><mo>&#8594;</mo><mrow><mi>dil</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>NaOH</mi></mrow></mover><mi>Pb</mi><msub><mfenced><mi>OH</mi></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msub></math>(white precipitate)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Bi</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mover><mo>&#8594;</mo><mrow><mi>dil</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>HCl</mi></mrow></mover><msub><mi>BiCl</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>(water-soluble)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Bi</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mover><mo>&#8594;</mo><mrow><mi>dil</mi><mo>.</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>NaOH</mi></mrow></mover><mi>Bi</mi><msub><mfenced><mi>OH</mi></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msub></math>(white precipitate)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Hg</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mover><mo>&#8594;</mo><mrow><mi>dil</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>HCl</mi></mrow></mover><msub><mi>HgCl</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>(water-soluble)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Hg</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mover><mo>&#8594;</mo><mrow><mi>dil</mi><mo>.</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>NaOH</mi></mrow></mover><mi>Hg</mi><msub><mfenced><mi>OH</mi></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msub></math>(yellow precipitate)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Ag</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mover><mo>&#8594;</mo><mrow><mi>dil</mi><mo>.</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>HCl</mi></mrow></mover><mi>AgCl</mi></math>(white precipitate)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Ag</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mover><mo>&#8594;</mo><mrow><mi>dil</mi><mo>.</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>NaOH</mi></mrow></mover><mi>AgOH</mi></math>(brown precipitate)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Zn</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mover><mo>&#8594;</mo><mrow><mi>dil</mi><mo>.</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>HCl</mi></mrow></mover><msub><mi>ZnCl</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>(water-soluble)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Zn</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mover><mo>&#8594;</mo><mrow><mi>dil</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mi>NaOH</mi></mrow></mover><mi>Zn</mi><msub><mfenced><mi>OH</mi></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msub></math>(white precipitate)</p>"
